{"steam_appid":3565480,"steam_name":"Roadhouse Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3565480/391040727/a461ccbad0fc750da168b0143d993bf9564cfd03/1790005530/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790009112","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257430756/4d0646d67872389ae8dc8fab6be741478c3b301a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790009112","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/681abd28b7feb7b3e64d33e091495c9de9cf9a70/ss_681abd28b7feb7b3e64d33e091495c9de9cf9a70.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790680193","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/27e4f30890393697ae8ba53e2ea576f27c5ade2a/ss_27e4f30890393697ae8ba53e2ea576f27c5ade2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790680193","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/cfb8d9eec45b45930ad6da37ecc6ea1db6aeeadf/ss_cfb8d9eec45b45930ad6da37ecc6ea1db6aeeadf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790680193","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/95298712dc1e6cad2b680288ec31b8101800c849/ss_95298712dc1e6cad2b680288ec31b8101800c849.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790680193","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/6394f92aa893c6436cadcc095a794b4b06242046/ss_6394f92aa893c6436cadcc095a794b4b06242046.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790680193"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome back to Route 66. This story starts a little earlier.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pour beer. Break up brawls. Run pig races. Distill your own liquor. Make deals out back. And when the cops show up, act natural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roadhouse Simulator</strong> is a standalone prelude to <i>Gas Station Simulator</i>, following Uncle as he takes charge of a rundown roadside bar with more problems than customers — and turns it into the rowdiest stop on the highway.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/68ecf5f2d57154bf2ae67e31a26b46dc.avif?t=1790680193\" width=1232 height=193 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/3e8df5dd9d4b9545f30536ea3562feaa.poster.avif?t=1790680193\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/3e8df5dd9d4b9545f30536ea3562feaa.webm?t=1790680193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/3e8df5dd9d4b9545f30536ea3562feaa.mp4?t=1790680193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start at the bottom…keeping the peace, watching the door, and dealing with rival gang members and drunks who can turn a quiet night into a brawl in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step in when you have to. Then build your way up with new stations, staff, and attractions until the whole Road House runs on your terms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/a32830477f9c4913fb33c8b358cb63d3.avif?t=1790680193\" width=1232 height=193 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/48d7494f188d5d72631e86abefc2eea6.poster.avif?t=1790680193\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/48d7494f188d5d72631e86abefc2eea6.webm?t=1790680193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/48d7494f188d5d72631e86abefc2eea6.mp4?t=1790680193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different brews can affect your customers in different ways, and serving the wrong person at the wrong time can get messy fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distill your own liquor, keep the beer flowing, the shelves stocked, and the staff paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And keep some spare furniture around. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/7f78a6ca824b407a6d67ff0c6399c4f3.avif?t=1790680193\" width=1232 height=193 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/d7e6f7f4916d6aaf58dfee8dcffc9f91.poster.avif?t=1790680193\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/d7e6f7f4916d6aaf58dfee8dcffc9f91.webm?t=1790680193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/d7e6f7f4916d6aaf58dfee8dcffc9f91.mp4?t=1790680193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire up the slots. Run pig races. Bring in the Hype Girls. Open the Fight Club…just don’t talk about that one. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more Hype you build, the faster the progression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful - more people means more money, but also more chaos. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/f96fd6480826976aeaf55d40d5d13fbd.avif?t=1790680193\" width=1232 height=193 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/83aaf8cca220240c8ad06456594f264e.poster.avif?t=1790680193\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/83aaf8cca220240c8ad06456594f264e.webm?t=1790680193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/83aaf8cca220240c8ad06456594f264e.mp4?t=1790680193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't do everything yourself forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire bartenders, servers, cleaners, and bouncers to handle the daily grind while you focus on growing the business or having fun with the pigs out back. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/0ac6db496f8c6b97a2a66c3038669d96.avif?t=1790680193\" width=1232 height=193 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/94d50c96899cffc0e20386209a1078fb.poster.avif?t=1790680193\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/94d50c96899cffc0e20386209a1078fb.webm?t=1790680193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565480/extras/94d50c96899cffc0e20386209a1078fb.mp4?t=1790680193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crime leaves evidence, and when you run the Road House, every mess becomes your problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep things clean, earn the law's trust, pay the price when things go wrong.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Bouncer to Boss</strong> - serve, manage, fight, and eventually run the whole Road House.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Drink Has Consequences</strong> -alcohol comes with risks that can trigger new problems around the Road House. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distill Your Own Liquor</strong> - process, improve, and bottle your own alcohol.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work Out the Back</strong> - stash, package, and deliver questionable cargo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw a Crowd</strong> - pig races, gambling, entertainment, and an underground Fight Club.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Crew</strong> - hire bartenders, cleaners, servers, and bouncers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deal With the Law</strong> - manage inspections, fines, and bribes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow the Business</strong> - expand the Road House and turn it into the wildest stop on Route 66</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3.0 GHz or Ryzen 3xxx<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (recent generetion)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1070 or better 6GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["DRAGO entertainment"],"publishers":["DRAGO entertainment"],"release_date":"Sep 21, 2026"}